---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ConversationDemo from "../components/ConversationDemo.astro";
import ConversationDemoTicket from "../components/ConversationDemoTicket.astro";
---
<Layout title="Lérins AI | AI conversations that convert" description="Replace static feedback forms with an intelligent AI concierge that answers questions, guides purchase decisions, and captures high-intent leads 24/7 with one line of code.">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-20 pt-20 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><p class="mb-5 inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">✦ Powered by Gemini AI Engine</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Turn casual browsers into buyers with real-time <span class="text-blue-600">AI conversation</span></h1><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-xl">Replace static feedback forms with an intelligent AI Concierge. Answer customer queries instantly, guide purchase decisions, and capture high-intent leads 24/7 with 1 line of code.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row"><a href="/get-started" class="rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-8 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-700">Get started free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="/dashboard" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-8 py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-50">Explore Dashboard</a></div></div></section>
    <ConversationDemo />
    <section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white py-12"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 text-center sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8"><div><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-600">+30%</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Average Conversion Lift</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Conversational AI guides intent-driven buyers in real time.</p></div><div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 md:border-l md:border-t-0 md:pt-0"><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-600">21x</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Faster Lead Qualification</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Responding within 5 minutes yields 21x higher qualification rates.</p></div><div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 md:border-l md:border-t-0 md:pt-0"><p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-600">80%</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Automated Support Resolution</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Instantly resolves common objections and questions.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="bg-blue-50/60 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Why static forms fail and AI chat converts</h2><blockquote class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-6 text-lg italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 shadow-sm">“Traditional feedback forms sit idle while prospective customers leave with unanswered questions. Conversational AI transforms passive visitors into active conversations, resolving doubts right at the moment of decision.”</blockquote><p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">By engaging users through dynamic, contextual dialog rather than rigid form fields, you turn basic customer feedback into interactive sales opportunities and qualified leads.</p></div></section>
    <ConversationDemoTicket />
    <section class="bg-white py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Engineered for higher conversions</h2><p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">Everything you need to automate customer support, collect feedback, and increase sales revenue.</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-8"><div class="mb-6 text-3xl">💬</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Instant AI Concierge</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Answers product queries, recommends items, and overcomes buying objections on autopilot using custom system prompts.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-8"><div class="mb-6 text-3xl">🎯</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Smart Action Chips</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Guide visitors with pre-configured prompt chips such as Pricing, Routes, and Best Sellers that drive immediate interaction.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-8"><div class="mb-6 text-3xl">📊</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Real-Time Insights</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Monitor transcript logs, analyze recurring user questions, and refine your marketing message from a central dashboard.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section id="integration" class="bg-white py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-10 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">1-Minute Integration</h2><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-slate-600">Add our lightweight AI widget before the closing <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-2 py-1 text-sm text-blue-600">&lt;/body&gt;</code> tag on any website.</p></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-xl bg-slate-950 p-6 shadow-2xl"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3"><span class="text-xs text-slate-400">plugin-embed.html</span><span class="text-xs text-emerald-400">● ready</span></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto text-sm text-blue-300"><code>&lt;script src="https://feedbackform.rivieraapps.com/plugin.js" async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre></div></div></section>
    <section id="faq" class="bg-blue-50/60 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4"><h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="mt-8 space-y-5"><details class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm" open><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-950">How does the AI assistant improve conversion rates?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">By providing immediate answers to buying questions, suggesting relevant products, and assisting users in real time, the widget eliminates friction before buyers exit your page.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-950">Can I customize the system prompt and styling?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Yes. You can customize colors, prompt chips, avatar icons, and the underlying AI system prompt to match your business tone and products.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-950">Is it difficult to set up on React, WordPress, or Shopify?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Not at all. Paste the single script tag into your HTML, or call it inside a React <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-xs text-blue-600">useEffect</code> hook in under two minutes.</p></details></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <script is:inline src="/plugin.js"></script>
</Layout>